# Sample requests for the finance tracker API.
# Install the VS Code extension "REST Client" (by Huachao Mao), start the
# server with `npm run dev`, then click "Send Request" above any request.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Is the server alive?
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Add income (amounts are in cents: 300000 = $3,000.00)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "income",
  "amountCents": 300000,
  "category": "salary",
  "date": "2026-11-01"
}

### Add an expense (no date → defaults to today)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "expense",
  "amountCents": 1250,
  "category": "groceries",
  "description": "milk & eggs"
}

### List all transactions (newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions

### List only one month
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?month=2026-11

### Get one transaction by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/1

### Replace a transaction (send every field)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/transactions/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "expense",
  "amountCents": 2000,
  "category": "groceries",
  "description": "milk, eggs, bread",
  "date": "2026-11-09"
}

### Delete a transaction
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/transactions/2

### Totals for everything
GET {{baseUrl}}/summary

### Totals for one month
GET {{baseUrl}}/summary?month=2026-11

### ❌ Bad data → 400 with a list of every problem
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "gift",
  "amountCents": -5
}

### ❌ Unknown route → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/nope
